- **Other diagnostics:**
  - `DS4_FLOW_STATS`: no Engram figure (`model.cu`:8096-8105).
  - `DS4_PROF`: GPU stages only. The Engram wait happens on the host before the layer (`model.cu`:8300-8320, 8520) and is
